Bind Npc 13013 Zone 21
Quest 97 "Werewolf skin"
    Journal "[Sentinel] Patrick asked me to bring 5 Apples of Moradon to him."
    Collect 5 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 20

Rewards
    Give 75000 experience

On available
    Say "Master, They say that [Sentinel] Patrick is collecting  Apple of Moradon. Let's go and see if we can profit from this."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Show quest "Please bring me Apple of Moradon. You already know that you can get apples if you catch werewolves even if I don't explain it to you, don't you? Ha ha..."

On in_progress
    Say "I need 5 Apples of Moradon."

On ready
    Say "You've collected all the Apple of Moradon. Let's go back and see Patrick now."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Good job. Here's a little something for you."
